  "description": "Application for a Non-Material Amendment Following a Grant of Planning Permission ref: 20/02374/RG3 (Redevelopment of the site comprising of the demolition of the existing buildings and erection of 4-storey and a 5-storey building to provide 27 residential units (Use Class C3) together with associated landscaping works) granted on 01.03.2021.\r\rAmendment sought :\r1. Minor changes of the alignment of the pre cast stone feature band and pre cast coping at the rear of block A \rand B. The coping is one brick course higher than on the approved elevations. \r\r2. Removal of the vertical recessed brick behind the rain water pipes, due to the way the walkways need to be \rdrained the recessed brick clashed with the rain water goods and precluded the collection of rainwater from \rthe walkway outlets. The brick recess was omitted to allow the rainwater to be collected effectively at the rear \rof the building only. \r\r3. The vertical one brick recess between the town house and block B was also omitted for practical buildability \rand drainage from the town house roof.\r\r\r4. Inclusion of fixed guarding to the roof access hatch of block A only, as advised for the health and Safety of\rmaintenance operatives. This is in addition to the man safe and lift up edge protection guarding to the roof.",
